{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02786","headline":"七日登乐游故墓 · 卢照邻","name":"七日登乐游故墓","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"四序周缇龠，三正纪璿耀。\n绿野变初黄，阳山开晓眺。\n中天擢露掌，匝地分星徼。\n汉寝睠遗灵，秦江想余吊。\n蚁泛青田酌，莺歌紫芝调。\n柳色摇岁华，冰文荡春照。\n远迹谢羣动，高情符衆妙。\n兰游澹未归，倾光下岩窈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢照邻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02786.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02786","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}